Patch for bertholomus/TensorFold, branch deepseek-v41-zig-tp2 @ c9c70953 (TensorFold, Apache-2.0),
rebased from the pack's zig-tp2-patches/0004-copy-min.patch (Object-Oriented Architects, 2026-10).

The pack's 0004 does not apply as shipped on this pin: its native.zig hunk's context moved.
Here config.zig, windows.zig and lanes.zig apply verbatim, and native.zig carries the same two
additions by hand (the TF_DS_COPY_MIN doc lines and its env parse).

